         <p class="oj-normal">On page 139, Article 35(3):</p>
         <p class="oj-normal">for:</p>
         <div>
            <div id="035.003">
               <p class="oj-normal">‘3.   The power to adopt delegated acts referred to in the fifth subparagraph of Article 7(3) shall be conferred on the Commission for a period of two years from 24 December 2018.’,</p>
            </div>
         </div>
         <p class="oj-normal">read:</p>
         <div>
            <div id="035.003">
               <p class="oj-normal">‘3.   The power to adopt delegated acts referred to in the fifth subparagraph of Article 7(3) shall be conferred on the Commission until 31 December 2021.’.</p>
